#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:692
msgid "I was unable to set up Thank You Page?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:692
msgid "Kindly visit our <a href=\"https://xlplugins.com/documentation/nextmove-woocommerce-thank-you-page/getting-started/\">documentation</a> to know more about how to setup thank you pages. "
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:693
msgid "Thank You page is not coming on frontend?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:693
msgid "Visit this step-by-step <a href=\"https://xlplugins.com/documentation/nextmove-woocommerce-thank-you-page/troubleshooting-guides/thank-you-page-didnt-show/\">documentation guide</a> to uncover the reasons for why Thank You Page may not be showing up.. "
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:694
msgid "Who is Next Move ideal for?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:694
msgid "Next Move is for WooCommerce store owners who want to generate repeat orders on autopilot. They understand the real potential of Thank You pages in the funnel but never had the right tools to exploit it."
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:695
msgid "Does NextMove Modify existing Thank You page or creates a new Thank You page?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:695
msgid "NextMove generates a new thank you page and adds components as defined by you."
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:696
msgid "What is referred to as a component?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:696
msgid "Each section on the WooCommerce Thank You page such as Order Confirmation, Items, Billing Information, Text, Image, HTML, Videos etc are referred to as a component."
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:697
msgid "What kind of components can I add to my Thank You Pages?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:697
msgid "There are 17 different components or what we call the building blocks in Thank You pages. See the pricing table to refer. You can choose and add whatever components you want on your Thank You Pages. It's as zippy and hassle-free as it sounds!"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:698
msgid "Can I customize the components to match my site's themes?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:698
msgid "Yes, all the components of Next Move can be customized. Match the skin colors to your store's theme, add borders, change the font size and more. Nothing is rigid here."
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:699
msgid "Can I turn off individual components?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:699
msgid "Absolutely! You can turn off different components based your choice and requirements."
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:700
msgid "Can I set up multiple Thank You Pages based on product or categories?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:700
msgid "Yes, You can set up as many Thank you pages as you like. You can dive deep and show Thank you pages to customers based on their order value, items purchased, payment gateways, shipping methods used, country of visitor and other parameters. Sky is the limit. Quite literally."
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:701
msgid "What is Rule Builder?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:701
msgid "Rule builder allows you set up different rules and only when conditions are met a particular thank you page is shown.<br/>Say you want to show specific thank you page based on different items purchased. You can set up the rule to show different pages when rules are met."
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:702
msgid "Do I need to make an order every time to preview the page?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:702
msgid "No, We have the feature to choose the preview order and look at how Thank You page would look. Once you are satisfied with the look, you can switch it."
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:703
msgid "Can I build Thank You page in sandbox mode until I finalized the page?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:703
msgid "Yes, There is a global setting in which you can choose to switch NextMove Mode to sandbox mode while building pages. Don't forget to switch to Live mode when done :)"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:704
msgid "I run my website in a different language. Can I change the text?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/xlwcty-admin.php:704
msgid "Yes, you can easily create Thank You Pages in your language. We are also compatible with WPML."
msgstr ""

